OL,3,GNEWSACouncil homes' residents complain
OL,4,Aabout maggots
OL,5,
OL,6,FA Surrey council's flagship housing
OL,7,Fproject where fire safety failings have
OL,8,Fbeen found is also being plagued by
OL,9,Fmaggots, residents say.
OL,11,FIn July, it emerged the fire safety
OL,12,Fcertificates at Runnymede Borough
OL,13,FCouncil's Addlestone One regeneration
OL,14,Fproject were not valid, leaving
OL,15,Fresidents in limbo.
OL,17,FNow, the Local Democracy Reporting
OL,18,FService says a group have filed a
OL,19,Fcomplaint urging the council to address
OL,20,Fthe maggot infestations in communal
OL,21,Fareas, as well as fire alarms going off
OL,22,Fand displaying "fault" messages.
OL,23,APub: 02-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBLon/SE NewsCReg TVFClean Feed
FL,328,320,200,140,0,100
